WEBVTT

00:06.597 --> 00:08.977
[MÖGE] It seems
the Great Kha'an was poisoned.

00:09.057 --> 00:11.687
But still,
if it really wasn't you,

00:11.767 --> 00:12.807
then that would mean

00:12.897 --> 00:14.107
-it was Töregene.
-[gasps]

00:15.647 --> 00:17.527
[KAM] The guardian spirits
have spoken,

00:17.607 --> 00:19.197
and they tell us
that saving the patient

00:19.277 --> 00:21.527
will require a sacrifice
in his stead.

00:21.617 --> 00:24.947
One of you must drink
every last drop of this water.

00:27.077 --> 00:28.867
Well then, looks like I'm up.

00:28.957 --> 00:30.077
♪

00:34.627 --> 00:35.707
[sighs]

00:41.507 --> 00:44.967
[♪ opening theme song playing]

02:19.187 --> 02:20.687
[Ögedei groans]

02:23.857 --> 02:25.157
I'm in pain.

02:26.777 --> 02:28.197
And I can't move.

02:31.287 --> 02:32.997
-[birds squawking]
-[ÖGEDEI] I must be...

02:33.697 --> 02:35.707
deep within the lower world.

02:36.827 --> 02:38.457
The immortal realm...

02:39.417 --> 02:41.337
where all the spirits
are said to dwell.

02:41.417 --> 02:42.377
[dog barks]

02:42.837 --> 02:44.797
Not even the kams themselves
would dare venture

02:44.877 --> 02:47.047
so deep in search of a soul.

02:48.427 --> 02:51.637
Is it now my fate to be held
captive here for eternity?

02:51.927 --> 02:53.057
[TOLUI] Brother!

02:53.137 --> 02:54.137
[Ögedei gasps]

02:54.227 --> 02:55.597
[footsteps]

02:55.687 --> 02:58.727
[TOLUI] So, this is where
you were, Ögedei.

02:58.807 --> 03:01.017
[ÖGEDEI] Tolui?
Why are you here?

03:01.107 --> 03:02.107
[Tolui grunts]

03:02.397 --> 03:04.687
I can't tell you how long
I have searched.

03:04.777 --> 03:07.357
After scouring
the upper and lower worlds,

03:07.447 --> 03:09.237
it seems I've finally found you.

03:09.317 --> 03:11.447
Come. Let's return.

03:13.197 --> 03:17.497
Tolui, I'm afraid
that will not be possible.

03:17.577 --> 03:18.577
[TOLUI] Uh?

03:19.377 --> 03:22.207
[ÖGEDEI] If a single soul were
to go missing from this tent,

03:22.287 --> 03:24.667
the spirits would
surely take notice.

03:24.757 --> 03:28.337
In anger, they could wreak havoc
upon the surface.

03:37.307 --> 03:39.017
[animals whine]

03:40.727 --> 03:43.647
Then you must allow me
to switch places with you.

03:43.727 --> 03:44.817
[ÖGEDEI] Huh?

03:46.857 --> 03:48.777
Tolui, please don't.

03:49.407 --> 03:52.447
Come now, all that
I've ever known is war.

03:52.527 --> 03:55.407
We've already vanquished
our longtime foes, the Jin.

03:55.497 --> 03:58.077
[laughs]

03:58.167 --> 03:59.207
♪

04:02.877 --> 04:04.037
Hmm.

04:04.127 --> 04:05.547
[Ögedei gasps]

04:05.627 --> 04:06.627
♪

04:10.387 --> 04:12.967
[TOLUI] You're the one
who'll forge the era

04:13.047 --> 04:14.757
to come with your cleverness.

04:14.847 --> 04:16.177
[ÖGEDEI] No! Tolui!

04:18.227 --> 04:20.267
Farewell, brother.

04:23.187 --> 04:25.437
[ÖGEDEI] Tolui!

04:25.517 --> 04:28.397
When you're back, I would like
for you to be careful.

04:29.237 --> 04:31.357
And in my stead,

04:31.447 --> 04:34.237
please watch over
Sorghaghtani for me!

04:34.327 --> 04:35.487
♪

04:38.157 --> 04:39.457
[Ögedei gasps]

04:39.537 --> 04:41.707
[breathes heavily]

04:47.047 --> 04:48.297
Great Kha'an.

04:49.167 --> 04:50.087
[chuckles]

04:50.177 --> 04:51.177
You've awakened.

04:52.967 --> 04:54.847
Boraqchin? [grunts]

04:56.007 --> 04:59.097
Where's Tolui?
Where is brother right now?

05:03.857 --> 05:04.977
[Boraqchin exhales]

05:06.647 --> 05:07.647
[Ögedei gasps]

05:09.607 --> 05:11.107
[footsteps receding]

05:11.737 --> 05:15.117
Everyone,
the Great Kha'an has come to.

05:16.527 --> 05:18.747
[cries]

05:19.497 --> 05:20.497
Tolui.

05:22.247 --> 05:23.627
[bleating]

05:27.997 --> 05:29.337
Uh? [gasps]

05:31.587 --> 05:35.337
Sir Qadaq's tent is gone.
How can this be?

05:36.387 --> 05:38.177
I needed to speak with him.

05:38.257 --> 05:41.057
Surely he knew what happened
to Lady Töregene.

05:41.137 --> 05:42.477
-[clink]
-Huh?

05:46.567 --> 05:47.767
This is...

05:47.857 --> 05:49.437
[Shira shouts] Fatima!

05:50.527 --> 05:51.987
-[pants]
-[SITARA] Shira?

05:57.157 --> 05:59.287
Prince Tolui has...
[breathes shakily]

05:59.657 --> 06:01.037
[Sitara breathes uneasily]

06:02.747 --> 06:03.867
What?

06:07.707 --> 06:09.587
[SHIRA]
It happened after the exorcism.

06:12.877 --> 06:14.467
[gasps]

06:14.547 --> 06:15.967
[neighs]

06:16.547 --> 06:18.807
[SHIRA] On his way back home
with the others,

06:18.887 --> 06:21.517
Prince Tolui suddenly had a fit.

06:21.597 --> 06:23.017
♪

06:27.557 --> 06:29.317
[Tolui grunting]

06:33.897 --> 06:35.197
[Sorghaghtani gasps]

06:36.817 --> 06:39.617
[SHIRA] He managed to return
to Princess Sorghaghtani's side.

06:42.407 --> 06:45.537
-But soon after, perished.
-[Sorghaghtani cries]

06:45.617 --> 06:47.127
♪

06:57.887 --> 06:59.847
[Shira sighs] It seems...

06:59.927 --> 07:02.467
he really did choose
to sacrifice himself.

07:02.887 --> 07:05.057
[SITARA] That can't be.

07:05.137 --> 07:07.137
The very thought is absurd.

07:07.227 --> 07:08.357
[Shira exhales]

07:08.437 --> 07:10.437
Which would mean he was...

07:10.517 --> 07:11.977
[Sitara gasps]

07:13.277 --> 07:14.687
Assassinated?

07:16.317 --> 07:19.907
Hold on. With everything that's
happened since yesterday,

07:19.987 --> 07:21.527
I feel so confused.

07:21.617 --> 07:26.707
Fatima, perhaps you shouldn't
go back to the House of Tolui.

07:26.787 --> 07:28.707
-[gasps]
-The Princess sent you

07:28.787 --> 07:31.337
to try and prevent
the very worst from occurring.

07:31.417 --> 07:34.047
And yet, that is precisely
what happened.

07:34.127 --> 07:36.297
So, she'll think
you've betrayed her trust.

07:36.797 --> 07:38.007
[Sitara gasps softly]

07:38.387 --> 07:42.177
Besides, now
that Prince Tolui isn't around,

07:42.257 --> 07:43.927
his house won't last long.

07:44.007 --> 07:45.307
[Sitara gasps]

07:45.387 --> 07:46.687
[SHIRA] From now on,

07:46.767 --> 07:49.017
the Great Kha'an
may have all the power.

07:49.647 --> 07:51.267
Should that be the case,

07:51.357 --> 07:53.857
I would love to serve
the House of Ögedei.

07:53.937 --> 07:54.977
[gasps]

07:55.067 --> 07:57.197
Say, Fatima...

07:57.277 --> 08:00.067
Do you think you could
put in a good word for me?

08:00.487 --> 08:02.367
Hey! Uh, you listening?

08:12.077 --> 08:14.247
[SITARA (ADULT)]
Tolui sacrificed his life

08:14.337 --> 08:16.837
so the Great Kha'an could live.

08:17.337 --> 08:20.217
While that may very well
be the truth,

08:20.297 --> 08:22.967
it could just as easily not be.

08:23.717 --> 08:25.677
But one thing is certain,

08:25.757 --> 08:28.387
following the death
of Prince Tolui,

08:28.477 --> 08:30.687
the power imbalance
that once prevailed

08:30.767 --> 08:32.187
within the empire...

08:32.767 --> 08:36.187
was about to undergo
an immeasurable shift.

08:38.527 --> 08:42.067
I now present
the jarghuchi, Shigi Qutuqu,

08:42.157 --> 08:44.527
who'll be announcing
the spoils of war.

08:46.577 --> 08:49.827
Here are the men we brought back
from the capital of Jin.

08:50.867 --> 08:52.077
-Scholars...
-Yes.

08:52.167 --> 08:53.997
...physicians, engineers.

08:54.087 --> 08:57.167
They're sure to contribute
to our nation's development.

08:58.587 --> 09:01.087
So this is the gift
you mentioned?

09:07.637 --> 09:09.387
Did you call for me?

09:11.387 --> 09:13.187
I spoke to the jarghuchi.

09:13.647 --> 09:15.267
He told me you went
against the law

09:15.357 --> 09:17.977
by arguing for more land
and subjects for your son.

09:18.067 --> 09:19.687
[Kirgistani yelps]

09:21.527 --> 09:23.777
[KIRGISTANI] My son made
valuable contributions

09:23.867 --> 09:25.197
to the Jin expedition!

09:25.277 --> 09:27.237
You do realize
what he accomplished,

09:27.327 --> 09:28.407
-don't you?
-Mother!

09:28.497 --> 09:30.117
[Kirgistani screaming]

09:30.207 --> 09:32.657
-Pardon us. Pay her no mind.
-[KIRGISTANI] Godan!

09:32.747 --> 09:34.957
[GODAN] Mother, please!
Try and calm down, all right?

09:35.037 --> 09:37.457
Wait! Ow! Let go! That hurts!
[screams]

09:37.537 --> 09:41.337
[laughs nervously]
Well, you see, uh...

09:41.417 --> 09:45.387
That wish of yours
may be granted soon enough.

09:45.467 --> 09:46.677
[KIRGISTANI] Uh...

09:47.597 --> 09:48.507
Huh?

09:49.927 --> 09:52.227
[Boraqchin chuckles]

10:01.567 --> 10:02.527
[Sitara gasps]

10:02.607 --> 10:04.657
-[grunts] Right there.
-Huh?

10:04.737 --> 10:06.027
-[exclaims]
-[chuckles]

10:09.487 --> 10:10.657
[Sitara sighs]

10:12.827 --> 10:13.997
[BORAQCHIN] Fatima.

10:14.077 --> 10:15.077
[Sitara gasps]

10:15.497 --> 10:16.837
It's the Empress.

10:19.667 --> 10:21.297
What brings you here?

10:21.377 --> 10:22.917
[BORAQCHIN]
Your selfless efforts

10:23.007 --> 10:25.637
have made the Great Kha'an's
recovery possible.

10:26.337 --> 10:28.257
And to show my gratitude...

10:29.887 --> 10:31.927
I want you to have this.

10:32.847 --> 10:34.017
[SITARA] What?

10:35.887 --> 10:37.517
"Elements?"

10:38.017 --> 10:39.767
[BORAQCHIN]
I mentioned to Sorghaghtani

10:39.857 --> 10:41.937
that you had
long been seeking this book,

10:42.027 --> 10:44.237
and she gladly agreed
to part with it.

10:45.067 --> 10:46.867
[SITARA]
That I had been seeking it...

10:48.317 --> 10:50.777
[gasps] How did you know?

10:50.867 --> 10:51.997
[Boraqchin chuckles]

10:52.407 --> 10:54.367
[SITARA]
Did Lady Töregene tell you?

10:54.457 --> 10:56.327
-Fatima.
-Uh?

10:56.827 --> 10:59.497
You need to forget
about that woman now.

10:59.587 --> 11:00.627
[Sitara gasps]

11:01.247 --> 11:02.877
[BORAQCHIN]
I'll have her tent dismantled

11:02.957 --> 11:04.297
by the end of today.

11:04.917 --> 11:07.967
You can relocate
next to my tent immediately.

11:09.297 --> 11:10.797
Empress Boraqchin.

11:10.887 --> 11:12.057
[BORAQCHIN] Come.

11:12.507 --> 11:14.427
There's something
I want to show you.

11:14.517 --> 11:15.387
[SITARA] Uh?

11:19.687 --> 11:21.267
[Sitara gasps]

11:21.357 --> 11:22.647
♪

11:26.397 --> 11:28.817
So, did Princess Sorghaghtani

11:28.907 --> 11:31.077
relinquish all these books
to you?

11:31.157 --> 11:33.787
Indeed. Rather graciously.

11:34.617 --> 11:37.367
Uh, yes, but she said...

11:38.167 --> 11:40.667
And I wish to learn more.
About the lands

11:40.747 --> 11:43.957
within reach of Mongol hooves,
and the ones even farther.

11:45.337 --> 11:46.717
[BORAQCHIN]
What happened to Tolui

11:46.797 --> 11:48.677
was unquestionably tragic.

11:49.137 --> 11:50.347
That said...

11:51.297 --> 11:54.057
I believe it was a portent
from the heavens.

11:54.137 --> 11:55.387
[Sitara gasps]

11:55.477 --> 11:58.767
For, you see, the Great Kha'an
has the wisdom

11:58.847 --> 12:01.267
to lead our empire
into a new age.

12:01.357 --> 12:04.437
Yet, Tolui would have proved
quite meddlesome

12:04.517 --> 12:06.067
in bringing
all this to fruition.

12:07.317 --> 12:09.277
You told me as much yourself.

12:09.357 --> 12:11.567
You were afraid
of the House of Tolui

12:11.657 --> 12:14.277
dominating in both might
and intelligence.

12:14.367 --> 12:15.747
[Sitara gasps]

12:16.827 --> 12:18.157
But now,

12:18.957 --> 12:21.787
I have the chance
to fix that imbalance.

12:22.837 --> 12:25.417
Fatima, it won't be might

12:25.507 --> 12:27.467
that commands
this empire's future.

12:27.547 --> 12:29.217
It will be wisdom.

12:29.297 --> 12:31.757
Don't you wish to harness
your own wisdom

12:31.837 --> 12:33.507
to its fullest extent?

12:34.177 --> 12:36.977
Could you imagine anything
more enjoyable?

12:38.597 --> 12:40.437
[Sitara exclaims]

12:47.487 --> 12:49.187
[wind blows]

12:53.867 --> 12:55.197
[gasps]

12:56.367 --> 12:57.617
♪

13:04.627 --> 13:06.547
[SITARA] Had I stayed in Tus,

13:06.627 --> 13:09.757
I would never have beheld
a sight so majestic.

13:09.837 --> 13:13.137
That's why I'm leaving here
on a journey,

13:13.217 --> 13:15.297
to engage with wisdom,

13:15.967 --> 13:18.177
and search for truth.

13:18.977 --> 13:20.307
♪

13:22.517 --> 13:23.977
[SITARA] Master Muhammad...

13:24.767 --> 13:28.147
I felt so frustrated
watching you leave us that day.

13:29.357 --> 13:31.067
I was filled with envy.

13:31.737 --> 13:33.487
You were free
to journey anywhere,

13:33.567 --> 13:35.697
and follow your heart.

13:36.237 --> 13:37.367
♪

13:37.447 --> 13:39.157
I've already learned
and experienced

13:39.247 --> 13:41.207
far more than you ever did

13:41.287 --> 13:43.167
in the brief time
that you were alive.

13:44.457 --> 13:47.337
Maybe the moment's
finally come...

13:48.047 --> 13:50.967
for me to move on
with the rest of my life.

13:51.047 --> 13:53.127
[wind blows]

13:53.217 --> 13:54.637
-[loud clanging]
-[gasps]

13:56.757 --> 13:58.307
[clanging]

14:05.607 --> 14:07.307
[SOLDIER 1] Hold on.
What was that?

14:07.397 --> 14:08.857
[SOLDIER 2]
Uh, hey, you all right?

14:08.937 --> 14:11.437
[SOLDIER 3] I'm sorry.
This pillar just toppled over.

14:11.527 --> 14:12.607
[Sitara gasps]

14:12.897 --> 14:15.317
I thought surely
lightning had struck out here.

14:16.487 --> 14:17.867
[Sitara gasps]

14:19.077 --> 14:20.577
[Muhammad laughs]

14:20.657 --> 14:22.957
Everyone down there
was so afraid.

14:23.037 --> 14:24.327
♪

14:25.877 --> 14:28.997
As of now,
you have no idea where you are,

14:29.087 --> 14:30.547
what's really happening,

14:30.627 --> 14:32.547
or what is going
to become of you.

14:32.627 --> 14:34.757
Your life's full of unknowns.

14:37.927 --> 14:39.967
[SITARA] How could I have
possibly imagined

14:40.057 --> 14:42.177
I was cleverer
than Master Muhammad?

14:43.227 --> 14:45.387
Where is my true place
in this world?

14:47.607 --> 14:49.687
Euclid's Elements.

14:50.857 --> 14:54.027
The book my mistress
tried to protect.

14:54.777 --> 14:57.157
The book that would ultimately
be the cause

14:57.237 --> 14:59.237
of her tragic death.

14:59.987 --> 15:03.497
The man who took
my mistress's life is no more.

15:04.707 --> 15:06.827
My single purpose in life

15:06.917 --> 15:09.037
was to somehow
retrieve that book

15:09.127 --> 15:11.037
and take it back as her slave.

15:11.627 --> 15:12.757
♪

15:13.167 --> 15:17.297
Mistress Fatima, I've succeeded
in what I set out to do.

15:20.507 --> 15:21.757
A slave?

15:22.257 --> 15:23.517
[gasps]

15:25.637 --> 15:27.137
Empress Boraqchin...

15:27.977 --> 15:30.227
Were you told
of my particular interest

15:30.307 --> 15:32.607
in this book,
and why I sought it out?

15:32.687 --> 15:33.857
[BORAQCHIN] Uh?

15:34.647 --> 15:37.647
I believe it's a treatise
on geometry, is it not?

15:38.407 --> 15:41.737
I was told you had an interest
in the subject for a long time.

15:41.827 --> 15:43.997
And that you take after
your father,

15:44.077 --> 15:45.957
who was a known scholar,
wasn't he?

15:46.037 --> 15:47.157
[Sitara gasps]

15:49.917 --> 15:51.037
[chuckles]

15:52.917 --> 15:55.797
Yes, it's just as you said.

15:59.337 --> 16:00.887
♪

16:07.927 --> 16:09.977
[SITARA]
Now I'm sure of one thing.

16:10.557 --> 16:13.147
Empress Boraqchin definitely
heard about this book

16:13.227 --> 16:14.647
from Lady Töregene.

16:15.527 --> 16:18.027
I can't guess
what might have transpired,

16:18.697 --> 16:20.947
but what I can say is...

16:21.947 --> 16:24.777
My name is Sitara. I am a slave.

16:25.657 --> 16:28.457
That's why
I chose to hide my past,

16:28.537 --> 16:31.037
and kept it a secret
from everyone I could.

16:31.747 --> 16:33.627
Please keep it a secret, too.

16:33.707 --> 16:35.297
[SITARA] Lady Töregene...

16:35.377 --> 16:39.257
never once divulged
the secrets we shared.

16:39.837 --> 16:41.967
Nor the anger we bear.

16:42.427 --> 16:43.797
♪

16:59.107 --> 17:00.737
[SHIRA] You worked hard today.

17:00.817 --> 17:02.107
[horse snorts]

17:22.927 --> 17:24.387
[sighs]

17:26.927 --> 17:29.717
[whistling]

17:31.847 --> 17:33.347
[continues whistling]

17:34.517 --> 17:36.017
-[SITARA] Shira.
-[SHIRA] Huh?

17:36.107 --> 17:37.437
Fatima?

17:37.527 --> 17:38.817
I thought I told you

17:38.897 --> 17:40.187
-not to come back here.
-I know.

17:40.277 --> 17:42.027
But I could use your help.

17:42.107 --> 17:44.277
Just answer my question,
and I'll introduce you

17:44.367 --> 17:46.447
to the Great Kha'an
or the Great Khatun.

17:46.867 --> 17:48.657
Very well, ask me anything.

17:49.487 --> 17:51.447
Before, you told me
the House of Tolui

17:51.537 --> 17:53.997
wouldn't last too long.
Why's that?

17:54.457 --> 17:56.837
Think about it.
With Prince Tolui gone,

17:56.917 --> 17:58.797
Princess Sorghaghtani
and the others

17:58.877 --> 18:01.757
probably won't be able to
hold onto their influence now.

18:02.547 --> 18:04.547
In fact, a little earlier...

18:06.427 --> 18:10.267
[HULEGU] But Mother, they took
so many of your books,

18:10.887 --> 18:13.687
and you're not saying anything?

18:13.767 --> 18:18.357
And that book, Elements,
if I'm not mistaken,

18:18.437 --> 18:21.147
didn't Father bring it
all the way from Persia for you?

18:22.237 --> 18:23.817
[SORGHAGHTANI] It's fine.

18:24.857 --> 18:28.577
At this point,
I've no further need for it.

18:28.657 --> 18:31.787
The Great Khatun can take
anything she wants.

18:32.407 --> 18:34.617
Ugh. I have no interest

18:34.707 --> 18:37.207
in following somebody
who's lost all hope.

18:38.247 --> 18:39.917
-[Sitara exhales]
-[gasps]

18:39.997 --> 18:42.957
[SITARA] It was...
It was her. [cries]

18:43.417 --> 18:47.507
I've been at the mercy
of Empress Boraqchin all along.

18:47.597 --> 18:48.717
I hate this.

18:49.847 --> 18:53.517
I believed I was smarter
than everyone around me,

18:53.597 --> 18:55.727
and challenged her
completely unaware.

18:55.807 --> 18:56.727
[Shira gasps softly]

18:56.807 --> 18:58.687
[Sitara cries]

19:02.977 --> 19:06.447
But right now isn't the time
to dwell on this.

19:09.407 --> 19:12.947
Shira, I beg you.
Please help me.

19:13.037 --> 19:15.907
There is someone
I need to save now. Chuu!

19:15.997 --> 19:17.287
[SHIRA] Uh, wait!

19:17.377 --> 19:20.037
Hold on.
Don't just leave me behind.

19:20.127 --> 19:21.667
[grunts, pants]

19:22.457 --> 19:23.417
Chuu!

19:24.417 --> 19:25.917
♪

20:15.967 --> 20:17.677
-[SITARA] Sir Qadaq...
-Uh?

20:17.767 --> 20:20.517
Fatima, you found me.

20:20.597 --> 20:24.187
Here. This is your
branding iron, am I right?

20:24.277 --> 20:25.277
[Qadaq gasps]

20:25.357 --> 20:27.027
-[breathes uneasily]
-[SITARA] Uh?

20:27.107 --> 20:28.607
[SITARA] Sir Qadaq...

20:28.697 --> 20:31.697
Where is Lady Töregene?
Please tell me she's safe!

20:34.947 --> 20:36.447
Let me assure you,

20:36.537 --> 20:39.747
I'm doing all I can
to make sure she's safe.

20:39.827 --> 20:41.577
On my master's orders, that is.

20:41.667 --> 20:44.707
-Master?
-Isn't that Lady Töregene?

20:44.797 --> 20:46.877
I've told you countless times,
she's not!

20:46.957 --> 20:48.007
[sighs]

20:48.467 --> 20:49.467
[grunts]

20:49.797 --> 20:52.637
It's a rather long story.
Come with me.

20:59.137 --> 21:01.597
[QADAQ]
Prince Güyük, I'm coming in.

21:02.767 --> 21:04.107
[Sitara gasps]

21:04.647 --> 21:06.147
There's no one here.

21:06.687 --> 21:09.897
[QADAQ]
Prince Güyük, it's me, Qadaq.

21:09.987 --> 21:11.277
[Güyük yelps]

21:11.357 --> 21:12.777
[whimpers]

21:14.947 --> 21:16.037
Qadaq?

21:16.447 --> 21:17.487
[BOTH] Huh?

21:17.577 --> 21:19.447
Oh, it's just you?

21:19.537 --> 21:21.207
I thought a stranger was...

21:21.287 --> 21:22.457
[yelps]

21:23.207 --> 21:24.587
[SITARA] Uh, an honor to--

21:24.667 --> 21:26.497
-[screaming]
-[all yelp]

21:26.587 --> 21:28.297
-[Qadaq sighs]
-[whimpers]

21:28.377 --> 21:31.547
[GÜYÜK] Qadaq! Qadaq!
Who is she? Send her away!

21:31.627 --> 21:32.887
[QADAQ] Well,
the prince's temperament

21:32.967 --> 21:34.757
can be quite unpredictable.

21:34.847 --> 21:37.467
Today is not your day. Get out.

21:37.557 --> 21:38.807
[BOTH] Huh?

21:38.887 --> 21:40.517
Come on, you aren't
really serious, are you?

21:41.057 --> 21:43.847
Qadaq,
what is the meaning of this?

21:43.937 --> 21:45.727
-It's like I said--
-[GÜYÜK] Qadaq!

21:45.807 --> 21:47.017
[Qadaq groans]

21:47.107 --> 21:49.277
I beg of you!
I don't know who that man is,

21:49.357 --> 21:51.237
but Lady Töregene
needs his help.

21:51.317 --> 21:53.487
[QADAQ] Well, this is
her firstborn son!

21:54.237 --> 21:56.737
[Güyük whimpering]

21:56.827 --> 21:58.197
[Qadaq sighs]

21:59.197 --> 22:03.287
The Great Kha'an
and Lady Töregene

22:03.367 --> 22:04.577
are his parents.

22:04.667 --> 22:06.167
[Sitara gasps]

22:06.787 --> 22:07.957
What?

22:08.047 --> 22:11.087
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:38.137 --> 23:41.967
[SITARA (ADULT)] Next time,
"An Ungraceful Stone."
